<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Folk on Blog de Pocallum — camera &amp; action!</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/tag/folk/</link><description>Recent content in Folk on Blog de Pocallum — camera &amp; action!</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ca</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 10 May 2025 00:00:00 +0200</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/tag/folk/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>2025-05-09 - Halim Yousfi + a la Nau Bostik</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2025/05/10/2025-05-09-halim-yousfi-a-la-nau-bostik/</link><pubDate>Sat, 10 May 2025 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2025/05/10/2025-05-09-halim-yousfi-a-la-nau-bostik/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/gqcUxffPfPJRUmbf9"&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.pocallum.cat/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/IMG_7505-1024x683.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aquest passat divendres 9 de maig, dins la &lt;a href="https://naubostik.com/esdeveniment/concert-%C2%B7-halim-yousfi/"&gt;Nau Bostik&lt;/a&gt;, es va celebrar el &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://tunezfest.com"&gt;Túnez Fest&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, un nou projecte cultural que neix amb l’objectiu de fer intercanvi cultural entre Tunísia i Catalunya, donant visibilitat a la riquesa artística, musical i gastronòmica tunisiana, i creant espais de trobada entre cultures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Per anar escalfant l’ambient previ al concert principal, la vetllada es va iniciar amb l’&lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/mchelmiro/"&gt;MC Helmiro&lt;/a&gt;, acompanyat per &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/dj_douds/"&gt;DJ Douds&lt;/a&gt;, als quals s’hi va unir la percussionista &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/saadnarjess/"&gt;Narjess&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Questioni Meridionale, música folk del sud d'Italia</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2012/10/21/questioni-meridionale-musica-folk-del-sud-d39/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Oct 2012 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2012/10/21/questioni-meridionale-musica-folk-del-sud-d39/</guid><description>&lt;table&gt;
